<title>USA: Houston Exploration to boost spending.</title>
<headline>Houston Exploration to boost spending.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Houston Exploration Co said on Tuesday that it increased its 1997 capital budget to $100 million from the previously established $75 million level.</p>
<p>Increased spending will reflect accelerated drilling activity, principally on exploratory prospects later this year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The capital budget will be funded through internally generated cash flow and the company's borrowing capacity, Houston Exploration said.</p>
</text>
